00:08:39.560 --> 00:08:44.160
You can see that there's some different vocabulary but
the sentences are translatable word for word.

00:08:44.460 --> 00:08:48.280
Notice that, in both languages,
the subject pronoun is normally optional.

00:08:48.380 --> 00:08:51.000
because the verb is conjugated for person and number.

00:08:51.000 --> 00:08:51.980
Another example.

00:08:52.300 --> 00:08:53.320
In Spanish:

00:08:55.280 --> 00:08:56.080
